{
  "app_id": 4609470,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "'Your party died again' is an incremental dungeon crawler with rapid character progression. Allow your party members to do most of the fighting for you as you collect the loot. Unlock the Priest, the Ranger and the Mage to create an undefeatable party of heroes. Explore 225 skill nodes within 4 skill trees using unique resources to empower each hero independently. Use 8 different abilities tactically to gain an edge or put them on auto cast to sit back and enjoy the ride. Fight through 7 different levels with unique monsters and mechanics to overcome. (Estimated playing time of 5 hours)"
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
    "en": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Your party died again' is an incremental dungeon crawler with rapid character progression. Allow your party members to do <u>most</u> of the fighting for you as you collect the loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609470/extras/71f45fa27f25a70b04b94943c3e90cb3.poster.avif?t=1795501805\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609470/extras/71f45fa27f25a70b04b94943c3e90cb3.webm?t=1795501805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609470/extras/71f45fa27f25a70b04b94943c3e90cb3.mp4?t=1795501805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Unlock the Priest, the Ranger and the Mage to create an undefeatable party of heroes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609470/extras/aacdfe255e3b7e87d2d77f6344b1d3c9.poster.avif?t=1795501805\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609470/extras/aacdfe255e3b7e87d2d77f6344b1d3c9.webm?t=1795501805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609470/extras/aacdfe255e3b7e87d2d77f6344b1d3c9.mp4?t=1795501805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 225 skill nodes within 4 skill trees using unique resources to empower each hero independently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4609470/extras/ddcb65d5888e1ac579ed7